  "officialHtml": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/saf-c3200.html",
  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 3202.10 Mobile service garage",
  "priorExpiration": "2024-02-15",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 3202.10 “Mobile service garage” means “mobile service garage” as defined in RSA 259:56-b.\n\nSource. #13727, INTERIM, eff 8-19-23, EXPIRES 2-15-24; ss by #13920, eff 4-5-24 (formerly Saf-C 3202.091)\n\nSaf-C 3202. 11 “Motorcycle-only inspection station” means an inspection station authorized by the department to conduct only motorcycle safety inspections pursuant to RSA 266:1, V-a and not required to conduct on-board diagnostics-II emission testing pursuant to RSA 266:59-b.\n\nSource. (See Revision Notes at Chapter Heading Saf-C 3200) #8915, eff 6-22-07, EXPIRED: 6-22-15\n\nNew. #10886, INTERIM, eff 7-16-15, EXPIRES: 1-12-16; ss by #11016, eff 1-6-16 (from Saf-C 3202.08); renumbered by #13920 (formerly Saf-C 3202.10)\n\nSaf-C 3202. 12 “Motor vehicle inspection station” means an inspection station authorized by the department to conduct motor vehicle inspections pursuant to RSA 266:1.\n\nSource. (See Revision Notes at Chapter Heading Saf-C 3200) #8915, eff 6-22-07, EXPIRED: 6-22-15\n\nNew. #10886, INTERIM, eff 7-16-15, EXPIRES: 1-12-16; ss by #11016, eff 1-6-16 (from Saf-C 3202.09); renumbered by #13920 (formerly Saf-C 3202.11)\n\nSaf-C 3202. 13 “Multipurpose passenger vehicle” means any motor vehicle, except a trailer, designed to carry 10 persons or less and which has a maximum height of 30 inches from the manufacturer, measured from the bottom of the frame rails of the vehicle.\n\nSource. (See Revision Notes at Chapter Heading Saf-C 3200) #8915, eff 6-22-07, EXPIRED: 6-22-15\n\nNew. #10886, INTERIM, eff 7-16-15, EXPIRES: 1-12-16; ss by #11016, eff 1-6-16 (from Saf-C 3202.10); renumbered by #13920 (formerly Saf-C 3202.12)",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/saf-c3200.html"
}
